{"sha": "ea975b7dce5f1641da8bb1f866154dc064921b478b7a907d133030fc0b8f63df", "body": ["（c）将 $x = Px + (x - Px)$ 分解，其中 $Px \\in F$ 且 $x -", "Px \\in F^\\perp = \\overline{\\operatorname{im}(U - I)}$（由", "(a) 部分）：$A_nx = Px + A_n(x - Px) \\to Px + 0$。", "", "（d）在傅里叶基 $e_m(x) = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi mx}$ 中：$Ue_m", "= \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi m\\alpha}e_m$，故 $Ue_m = e_m$ 当且仅当 $m\\alpha", "\\in \\Z$ 当且仅当 $m = 0$（$\\alpha$ 为无理数）：$F = \\C\\mathbf 1$", "且 $Pf = \\langle\\mathbf 1, f\\rangle\\mathbf 1 = \\int_0^1f$。", "定理即为 $\\frac1n\\sum_{k<n}f(\\cdot + k\\alpha) \\to", "\\int_0^1f$ 在 $L^2(\\R/\\Z)$ 中：无理旋转的轨道平均", "呈等分布 --- 此为 $L^2$ 意义下的", "外尔等分布定理的影子，由纯粹的", "希尔伯特几何即可得到。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b3:hilbert:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 格拉姆--施密特正交化保证", "$\\operatorname{Vect}(p_0, \\dots, p_n) =", "\\operatorname{Vect}(1, \\dots, t^n) = \\R_n[t]$ 且 $p_n \\perp", "p_k$（$k < n$），从而 $p_n \\perp \\R_{n-1}[t]$。$p_k$ 的", "次数严格递增，线性无关，构成基。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $t\\,p_n$ 是次数为 $n + 1$ 的首一多项式：展开", "$t\\,p_n = p_{n+1} + \\sum_{k\\leq n}c_kp_k$，其中 $c_k =", "\\langle p_k, tp_n\\rangle/\\norm{p_k}^2$。对 $k \\leq n - 2$：", "$\\langle p_k, tp_n\\rangle = \\langle tp_k, p_n\\rangle = 0$", "（次数 $k + 1 < n$）。于是 $tp_n = p_{n+1} + a_np_n +", "b_np_{n-1}$，即所述递推式，其中", "\\[", "b_n = \\frac{\\langle p_{n-1}, tp_n\\rangle}{\\norm{p_{n-1}}^2}", "= \\frac{\\langle tp_{n-1}, p_n\\rangle}{\\norm{p_{n-1}}^2}", "= \\frac{\\langle p_n + (\\text{低次项}),\\", "p_n\\rangle}{\\norm{p_{n-1}}^2}", "= \\frac{\\norm{p_n}^2}{\\norm{p_{n-1}}^2} > 0 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{3.} 设 $t_1 < \\dots < t_m$ 为", "$I$ 内部使 $p_n$ 变号的点，并令 $q = \\prod_{i\\leq m}(t -", "t_i)$（规定 $q = 1$，当 $m = 0$ 时）。于是 $p_nq$ 在", "$I$ 上符号恒定，且几乎处处不为零：$\\int_Ip_nq\\,w \\neq 0$。若 $m <", "n$，则与 $p_n \\perp \\R_{n-1}[t]$ 矛盾。于是 $m = n$：", "$p_n$ 恰有 $n$ 个互异的内部根（它至多有 $n$", "个根）。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $(t^2 - 1)^n$ 的次数为 $2n$；$n$ 次求导", "后次数仍为 $n$，首项系数为", "$\\frac{(2n)(2n-1)\\cdots(n+1)}{2^nn!} =", "\\frac{(2n)!}{2^n(n!)^2}$。对 $\\deg Q < n$，分部积分", "$n$ 次：所有边界项都含阶数", "$< n$ 的 $(t^2-1)^n$ 导数，它在 $\\pm1$ 处为零（", "$n$ 重根）。经 $n$ 步后，被积函数含 $Q^{(n)} = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 记 $u = (t^2 - 1)^n$：", "\\[", "(2^nn!)^2\\norm{P_n}^2 = \\int_{-1}^1(u^{(n)})^2", "= (-1)^n\\int_{-1}^1 u\\,u^{(2n)}", "= (2n)!\\int_{-1}^1(1 - t^2)^n\\dd t ,", "\\]", "（$u^{(2n)} = (2n)!$；边界项同第 4 题一样消失）。", "又 $\\int_{-1}^1(1-t^2)^n\\dd t = B(\\tfrac12, n+1) =", "\\frac{\\Gamma(\\frac12)\\Gamma(n+1)}{\\Gamma(n + \\frac32)} =", "\\frac{2\\cdot4^n(n!)^2}{(2n+1)!}$", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:product:8}）。综合得 $\\norm{P_n}^2 =", "\\frac{2}{2n + 1}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} 多项式在 $\\norm\\cdot_\\infty$ 意义下", "$\\mathcal C(\\intcc{-1}1)$ 中稠密（魏尔斯特拉斯，", "\\cref{cor:b3:complete:weierstrass}），连续函数在", "$L^2$ 意义下稠密（\\cref{thm:b3:lp:density}），且", "$\\norm\\cdot_2 \\leq \\sqrt2\\norm\\cdot_\\infty$：多项式张成", "的子空间稠密，故归一化的 $P_n$ 构成希尔伯特基。", "$\\abs t$ 的展开中，与 $P_0$ 对应的系数为", "$\\frac{\\langle P_0, \\abs t\\rangle}{\\norm{P_0}^2} = \\frac12$;", "与 $P_1$：$0$（由奇偶性）；与 $P_2$：", "$\\frac{\\int_{-1}^1\\abs t\\,\\frac{3t^2-1}2\\dd t}{2/5} =", "\\frac{1/4}{2/5} = \\frac58$。最佳二次逼近为：", "\\[", "\\abs t \\approx \\frac12 + \\frac58\\,P_2(t) = \\frac{3}{16} +", "\\frac{15}{16}\\,t^2 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{7.} 由 $\\frac{\\dd^{n+1}}{\\dd t^{n+1}}\\eu^{-t^2} =", "\\frac{\\dd^n}{\\dd t^n}(-2t\\,\\eu^{-t^2})$ 及莱布尼茨公式，$H_{n+1}", "= 2tH_n - H_n'$，由归纳法得次数为 $n$，首项", "系数为 $2^n$。对 $m < n$，分部积分 $n$ 次，", "即 $\\int H_m H_n\\eu^{-t^2} = (-1)^n\\int H_m\\,\\bigl(\\eu^{-t^2}", "\\bigr)^{(n)}$：边界项（多项式 $\\times$", "$\\eu^{-t^2}$）在 $\\pm\\infty$ 处为零，剩下 $\\int", "H_m^{(n)}\\,\\eu^{-t^2} = 0$。对 $m = n$：$H_n^{(n)} = 2^nn!$，", "故 $\\norm{H_n}_w^2 = 2^nn!\\int\\eu^{-t^2} = 2^nn!\\sqrt\\pi$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 设 $f \\in L^2(\\R, \\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t)$ 与", "每个多项式正交，令 $g = f\\eu^{-t^2}$。则 $g \\in", "L^1$：$\\int\\abs f\\eu^{-t^2} \\leq \\bigl(\\int\\abs", "f^2\\eu^{-t^2}\\bigr)^{1/2}\\bigl(\\int\\eu^{-t^2}\\bigr)^{1/2}$", "（柯西--施瓦茨不等式）。对 $\\xi \\in \\R$，展开 $\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi t}$：", "部分和被控制，因为", "\\[", "\\sum_k\\frac{\\abs\\xi^k}{k!}\\int\\abs f\\,\\abs t^k\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t", "\\leq \\Bigl(\\int \\abs f^2\\eu^{-t^2}\\Bigr)^{1/2}", "\\sum_k\\frac{\\abs\\xi^k}{k!}\\Bigl(\\int", "t^{2k}\\eu^{-t^2}\\Bigr)^{1/2} < \\infty", "\\]", "（最后的级数收敛：$\\int t^{2k}\\eu^{-t^2} =", "\\Gamma(k+\\frac12) \\leq k!\\,\\sqrt\\pi$，故各项为", "$O(\\abs\\xi^k/\\sqrt{k!})$）。逐项积分", "（对绝对值级数应用\\cref{cor:b3:lebesgue:additivity}，", "再对级数用富比尼定理）得", "\\[", "\\int_\\R g(t)\\,\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi t}\\dd t", "= \\sum_k\\frac{(-\\iu\\xi)^k}{k!}\\int f(t)\\,t^k\\,\\eu^{-t^2}\\dd t", "= 0 ,", "\\]", "每个积分都是 $\\langle t^k, f\\rangle_w$ 型，$= 0$。由", "在本阶段不加证明地承认的傅里叶变换单射性", "（见\\cref{ch:b3:fouriertransform}），$g = 0$ 几乎处处，故 $f = 0$", "几乎处处，故埃尔米特族（其张成为全体多项式）是", "稠密的。", ""]}